       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Still be watchful, it ain't a picnic!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Best of luck from Demoniaca team,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "XXX",
